{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 2.0500000000000003, "t": "Never pet another dog in front of yours.", "k": ["another"], "w": [0.056, 0.35, 0.549, 0.938, 1.137, 1.289, 1.583, 1.735]}, {"a": 2.0500000000000003, "b": 4.9430000000000005, "t": "It looks harmless, but your dog might take it personally.", "k": ["personally."], "w": [2.1, 2.252, 2.546, 3.053, 3.253, 3.499, 3.698, 3.993, 4.239, 4.391]}, {"a": 4.9430000000000005, "b": 7.746, "t": "Careful, a simple test showed how far they'll go.", "k": ["Careful,"], "w": [4.993, 5.453, 5.558, 5.899, 6.146, 6.487, 6.686, 6.886, 7.227]}, {"a": 7.746, "b": 13.325999999999999, "t": "In 2014, scientists at the University of California visited 36 dogs at home.", "k": ["2014,", "36"], "w": [7.796, 7.977, 8.817, 9.452, 9.633, 9.871, 10.506, 10.688, 11.323, 11.788, 12.264, 12.559, 12.74]}, {"a": 13.325999999999999, "b": 15.120999999999999, "t": "They asked each owner to ignore their", "k": ["ignore"], "w": [13.376, 13.613, 13.895, 14.132, 14.415, 14.56, 14.888]}, {"a": 15.120999999999999, "b": 16.802, "t": "dog and pet a stuffed dog instead.", "k": ["instead."], "w": [15.171, 15.362, 15.553, 15.745, 15.845, 16.218, 16.41]}, {"a": 16.802, "b": 19.226, "t": "One that barked, whined and wagged its tail.", "k": ["barked,"], "w": [16.852, 17.043, 17.28, 17.676, 18.004, 18.195, 18.523, 18.715]}, {"a": 19.226, "b": 21.262, "t": "Then they did the same with a plastic pumpkin,", "k": ["pumpkin,"], "w": [19.276, 19.491, 19.705, 19.879, 20.052, 20.267, 20.482, 20.572, 20.911]}, {"a": 21.262, "b": 22.875999999999998, "t": "and with a book read out loud.", "k": ["loud."], "w": [21.312, 21.485, 21.7, 21.791, 22.005, 22.22, 22.393]}, {"a": 22.875999999999998, "b": 23.521, "t": "With the book,", "k": ["book,"], "w": [22.926, 23.134, 23.302]}, {"a": 23.521, "b": 26.416, "t": "only about 2 in 10 dogs pushed or touched their owner.", "k": ["2", "10"], "w": [23.571, 23.779, 24.027, 24.236, 24.364, 24.7, 24.908, 25.197, 25.325, 25.653, 25.902]}, {"a": 26.416, "b": 29.006, "t": "With the fake dog, it was almost 8 in 10.", "k": ["8", "10."], "w": [26.466, 26.692, 26.874, 27.1, 27.347, 27.486, 27.668, 27.981, 28.207, 28.345]}, {"a": 29.006, "b": 30.535999999999998, "t": "Now the part that should worry you,", "k": ["should"], "w": [29.056, 29.226, 29.395, 29.605, 29.815, 30.106, 30.356]}, {"a": 30.535999999999998, "b": 32.776, "t": "because some dogs went further than pushing.", "k": ["pushing."], "w": [30.586, 30.917, 31.127, 31.337, 31.547, 31.878, 32.088]}, {"a": 32.776, "b": 35.886, "t": "About a third squeezed in between their owner and the fake dog.", "k": ["squeezed"], "w": [32.826, 33.09, 33.184, 33.449, 33.841, 33.978, 34.328, 34.592, 34.857, 35.036, 35.215, 35.437]}, {"a": 35.886, "b": 37.456, "t": "And some even snapped at it.", "k": ["snapped"], "w": [35.936, 36.116, 36.338, 36.561, 36.912, 37.049]}, {"a": 37.456, "b": 40.616, "t": "The test was borrowed from one used with six-month-old babies.", "k": ["six-month-old"], "w": [37.506, 37.698, 37.936, 38.128, 38.549, 38.787, 38.979, 39.216, 39.454, 40.012]}, {"a": 40.616, "b": 42.309000000000005, "t": "The scientists said the dogs seemed to", "k": ["scientists"], "w": [40.666, 40.842, 41.311, 41.529, 41.705, 41.923, 42.225]}, {"a": 42.309000000000005, "b": 44.446000000000005, "t": "be protecting their bond with their owner.", "k": ["protecting"], "w": [42.359, 42.493, 42.962, 43.222, 43.44, 43.658, 43.917]}, {"a": 44.446000000000005, "b": 46.583000000000006, "t": "So to your dog, it might not be just a pat.", "k": ["might"], "w": [44.496, 44.641, 44.786, 45.021, 45.279, 45.424, 45.705, 45.895, 46.04, 46.275, 46.375]}, {"a": 46.583000000000006, "b": 48.446000000000005, "t": "It's someone taking their place.", "k": ["someone"], "w": [46.633, 46.823, 47.195, 47.521, 47.801]}, {"a": 48.446000000000005, "b": 51.062000000000005, "t": "Tell me what your dog does when you pet another dog.", "k": ["another"], "w": [48.496, 48.74, 48.89, 49.135, 49.379, 49.576, 49.82, 50.064,